				<pubDate>Wed, 06 Jan 2021 22:29:13 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Doggol</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>6991250</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This doesn't work for me -<br /> For 1: There isn't a story, it's just a thing that kills you, and nothing more. It just seems designed to be a spooky satan armour.</p> <p>For 2: It is riddled with spelling mistakes, for instance:</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Description:</strong> is&#8230;</p> </blockquote> <p>Shouldn't it say SCP-XXXX is? This is only one example of this.</p> <p>For these reasons, I'll have to downvote this. I would try and go through the correct procedures for getting an article e.g</p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Ideas&#32;critique&#32;---&gt;&#32;Draft&#32;Critique&#32;----&gt;&#32;Posting.</span></p> <p>-1.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
