				<wikidot:authorName>CompleteIndie</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5632962</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Here is my <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">like, seventh?</span> first SCP! Meet SCP-5958!</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Spoilers,&nbsp;if&nbsp;you&nbsp;don't&nbsp;get&nbsp;it.</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Spoilers</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Basically, what's happening, is 5958 tricked Thatcher into marking it as explained.</p> </div> </div> </div> <p>If it's good, a +1 would be appreciated! If it's bad, a -1 would be appreciated! Regardless of thoughts, feedback would be a huge help, and overall, here's to hoping 2021 is better than the year before it!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13971274</guid>
				<title>SCP-5978</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13971274/scp-5978</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 06 Jan 2021 06:41:18 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>GreenBlob</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>6117650</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Ok, firstly I think the visual for the map of site-15&#160;A is too small and hard to read and too many underlines make it confusing, the article itself is understandable but I don't see much to really grab my attention, it is interesting but is &quot;generic scary thing but religion related&quot;<br /> (but I would prefer if the rendering had a rosary since most Christian nuns carry a rosary)</p> <p>And it is not really that scary, not very disturbing either, though that is much of personal opinion.</p> <p>Next I don't think it is realistic that the containment procedures require clearance, since what if all the people with clearance were busy with other SCP's then any remaining personnel would not be able to execute the procedure.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
