				<wikidot:authorName>Ralliston</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5986843</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The following article is a sequel to <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5936">SCP-5936</a>, <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/critter-profile-sparky">Critter Profile: Sparky!</a> and <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5890">SCP-5890</a>. Whilst you can read it on its own, it's highly recommended you read all of the previous installments to get this article in its fullest.</p> <p>Massive thank you to these people for crit:</p> <p><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/r4-ex" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6519177&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609674417" alt="R4_EX" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6519177)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/r4-ex" >R4_EX</a></span>| <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/veralta" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6030962&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609674417" alt="Veralta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6030962)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/veralta" >Veralta</a></span> | <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ethagon" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5844683&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609674417" alt="Ethagon" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5844683)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ethagon" >Ethagon</a></span> and the absolutely wonderful <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/harryblank" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6479803&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609674417" alt="HarryBlank" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6479803)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/harryblank" >HarryBlank</a></span> | <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dysadron" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4384469&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609674417" alt="Dysadron" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4384469)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dysadron" >Dysadron</a></span> | <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5903100&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609674417" alt="Pedagon" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5903100)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" >Pedagon</a></span> who are absolute treasures to this community and helped me work out the final product of this immensely.</p> <p>The Department of Ontokinetics logo used in the header was created by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3781861&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609674417" alt="EstrellaYoshte" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3781861)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" >EstrellaYoshte</a></span> for the purpose of all articles regarding such. Please check out more of their absolutely stellar work <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/desk-of-junior-designer-s-yvonne">here</a>.</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;spoilers</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;spoilers</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>It's an alien spaceship.</p> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>~ <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/ralliston-s-authorpage">check my authorpage out (it has dog photos)</a> ~</span></h2> </div> <hr /> 
